"Look in the upper-right menu bar. Click Nexus to open its menu, or drag a file onto the icon to copy its path." = "请查看屏幕右上角的菜单栏。点击天枢图标打开菜单，或将文件拖到图标上复制路径。";
"Using Hidden Bar or another menu bar organizer?" = "正在使用 Hidden Bar 或其他菜单栏整理工具？";
"Expand the hidden icons, find Nexus, and move or pin it into the visible menu bar area." = "先展开被隐藏的菜单栏图标，找到天枢，再将它移动或固定到始终可见的区域。";
"If you cannot find Nexus later" = "以后找不到天枢怎么办？";
"Open Nexus again from Finder or Applications to show this guide. You can also reopen it from Settings → General." = "从访达或「应用程序」中再次打开天枢，即可重新显示本指南；也可以在「设置 → 通用」中打开。";
"Open Settings…" = "打开设置…";
"Got it — start using Nexus" = "知道了，开始使用天枢";
"Show Welcome Guide…" = "显示首次使用指南…";
"Reopen the guide if the menu bar icon is hidden." = "若菜单栏图标被隐藏，可以在此重新打开使用指南。";
"Help" = "帮助";

/* Extended deletion confirmation challenge */
"Confirmation stage" = "确认阶段";
"Deletion confirmation progress" = "删除确认进度";
"You may cancel at any point. No statistics are deleted until the final confirmation." = "你可以随时取消。在完成最后一次确认之前，不会删除任何统计数据。";
"You can cancel now without deleting any statistics." = "现在取消将不会删除任何统计数据。";
"Clearing local history…" = "正在清理本地历史记录…";
"iCloud Drive and other File Provider locations may hide third-party Finder Sync commands. Use Finder > Services > Copy Selected Paths instead. Native Services must be enabled in macOS settings; macOS controls their menu placement." = "iCloud 云盘等文件提供者位置可能不显示第三方 Finder Sync 命令。可从「访达」>「服务」>「拷贝所选路径」使用备用入口。需要在 macOS 设置中启用服务；菜单的位置由系统决定。";
"The installed app has not yet registered a native Service. Finder Sync can be hidden in iCloud Drive and other File Provider folders; the macOS Services fallback is listed after registration." = "当前安装包尚未注册原生服务。iCloud 云盘等文件提供者位置可能隐藏 Finder Sync 菜单；安装注册后可使用 macOS「服务」中的备用命令。";
"This build is not signed for CloudKit. A container name alone is insufficient; use a development profile with the CloudKit capability, then reopen the newly signed app." = "此版本缺少有效的 CloudKit 签名权限。仅填写容器名称无效；请使用已启用 CloudKit 的开发配置文件重新签名安装，再打开应用。";
"CloudKit signing setup guide" = "CloudKit 签名配置指南";

// iCloud Drive user-folder synchronization
"iCloud Drive sync" = "iCloud 云盘同步";
"iCloud Drive clipboard folder" = "iCloud 云盘剪贴板同步文件夹";
"Choose NexusClipboardSync folder…" = "选择 NexusClipboardSync 文件夹…";
