"Enable folder clipboard synchronization" = "启用文件夹剪贴板同步";
"Automatically synchronize every 5 minutes" = "每 5 分钟自动同步";
"Synchronization is off by default. Nexus only reads and writes the folder you select, when authorized. Apple Files synchronizes it between devices independently." = "同步默认关闭。Nexus 只使用你选的文件夹；iCloud 云盘负责跨设备传输。";
"Select which clipboard data may be synchronized" = "选择允许同步的数据类别";
"Include copied text" = "同步复制的文本";
"Include names and collection titles" = "同步文件名与集合名称";
"Include original local file paths" = "同步原始本地路径";
"Original image and file bytes are not yet supported in folder synchronization. Paths on another device are descriptive only." = "目前只能同步文字和记录信息，暂不传输图片和文件原件。";
"Folder synchronization controls" = "文件夹同步操作";
"Prepare selected folder" = "准备所选文件夹";
"Prepare next 200 records" = "准备下一批 200 条历史";
"Import synced records into local history" = "将同步记录导入本地历史";
"Replay all folder changes" = "重新读取文件夹中的全部变更";
"Pending updates" = "待同步变更";
"Remove folder synchronization data" = "清除文件夹同步数据";
"Local cache reset preserves independently saved history. Deleting synchronized records removes only Nexus-owned JSON files from the selected folder. Other devices can upload old records again." = "清除本地同步缓存不会删除原有历史。删除云盘同步记录只会移除所选文件夹中 Nexus 创建的 JSON 文件。其他设备可能重新上传旧记录。";
"Clear local sync cache…" = "清除本地同步缓存…";
"Delete synchronized Nexus folder records…" = "删除 Nexus 文件夹同步记录…";
"Clear only the local folder sync cache?" = "仅清除当前设备的文件夹同步缓存？";
"Clear local cache" = "清除本地缓存";
"Original local clipboard history is preserved. Files in iCloud Drive are not deleted." = "原有本地剪贴板历史将保留，iCloud 云盘里的文件不会被删除。";
"Delete Nexus folder sync data" = "删除 Nexus 文件夹同步数据";
"This deletes Nexus-owned sync JSON documents in your selected folder, not the entire folder or unrelated iCloud Drive data. Disable synchronization on other devices first. Type DELETE to confirm." = "这会删除所选文件夹内 Nexus 创建的同步 JSON 文件，不会删除整个文件夹或其他 iCloud 云盘数据。请先关闭其他设备的同步，并输入 DELETE 确认。";
"Delete sync records" = "删除同步记录";
"Choose Nexus clipboard sync folder" = "选择 Nexus 剪贴板同步文件夹";
"Select your existing NexusClipboardSync folder in iCloud Drive." = "请在 iCloud 云盘中选择已有的 NexusClipboardSync 文件夹。";

